  "content": "\n\n<h3><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:18px\"><em><strong>英文版：</strong></em></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24px\">此附加元件為<strong>COBBLEVERSE 版本 1.7.30</strong>提供了完整的<strong>法文翻譯</strong>。</span></h2>\n<p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">它包含一個<strong>資源包，內含 COBBLEVERSE 中所有模組的視覺法文翻譯。</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h3><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若要使用 Cobbleverse 的法文對話、訓練家名稱與訓練家類型，請前往 Lumyverse Discord (<a href=\"https://discord.gg/zzFvRynA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/zzFvRynA</a>) 並進入附加元件區 (<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252fchannels%252f1144267528638570516%252f1470240945537683638\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">直接連結</a>)，下載包含資源包、資料包（datapack）及設定資料夾的整合包。</span></strong></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">此附加元件的目標是提供<strong>完全法文化的體驗</strong>，忠於原版內容，同時保持與<strong>COBBLEVERSE 及其世界觀</strong>（選單、物品、訓練家名稱與類型、對話、機制、Lumymon 功能等）的相容性。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>不會修改任何遊戲玩法功能 &mdash; 此<strong>僅為純翻譯</strong>。</em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>安裝指南：</strong></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">下載檔案 <em>COBBLEVERSE 1.7.30 Traduction FR Ressourcepacks.zip</em>&nbsp;，並將其安裝至您的 Minecraft 客戶端<strong>資源包資料夾</strong>中。請確保該檔案<strong>已啟用並置於第一位</strong>，以保證正確載入。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">大功告成，<strong style=\"font-size:14px\">Cobbleverse 現在已經是法文版了！</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<hr>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span><span>法文版：</span></span></span></em></strong></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span><span>此附加元件為</span></span><em><strong><span><span>COBBLEVERSE 版本 1.7.30</span></span></strong></em><span><span>提供了完整的<span></span><em><strong><span><span>法文</span></span></strong></em><span><span>翻譯。</span></span></span></span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span><span>它包含一個</span></span><strong><span><span>資源包</span></span></strong><span><span>，內含 COBBLEVERSE 中所有模組的視覺</span></span><strong><span><span>法文翻譯</span></span></strong><span><span>。</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h3><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span><span>若要使用</span></span><span><span>Cobbleverse 法文對話</span></span><span><span>以及</span></span><span><span>訓練家名稱與類型</span></span><span><span>，請前往</span></span><span><span>Lumyverse Discord</span></span><span><span> (</span></span><a href=\"https://discord.gg/zzFvRynA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span><span>https://discord.gg/zzFvRynA</span></span></a><span><span>) 並進入</span></span><span><span>附加元件區</span></span><span><span> (</span></span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252fchannels%252f1144267528638570516%252f1470240945537683638\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span><span>直接連結</span></span></a><span><span>)，下載包含資源包、</span></span><span><span>資料包</span></span><span><span>及</span></span><span><span>設定資料夾</span></span><span><span>的整合包。</span></span></span></strong></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span><span>此附加元件的目標是提供</span></span><strong><span><span>完全法文化的體驗，忠於原版內容，同時保持與 COBBLEVERSE 及其世界觀的相容性</span></span></strong><span><span>（選單、物品、訓練家名稱與類型、對話、機制、Lumymon 功能等）。</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em><span><span>不會修改任何遊戲玩法功能 &mdash; 此僅為純翻譯。</span></span></em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span><span>安裝指南：</span></span></strong></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span><span>下載檔案</span></span><em><span><span>COBBLEVERSE 1.7.30 Traduction FR Ressourcepacks.zip</span></span></em><span><span>，並安裝至您的 Minecraft 客戶端<strong>資源包資料夾</strong>中。請確保該檔案<strong>已啟用</strong>且<strong>置於第一位，以確保正確載入</strong>。</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em><strong><span><span>大功告成，Cobbleverse 現在已經是法文版了！</span></span></strong></em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span><span>已翻譯並包含在 COBBLEVERSE 中的模組列表：</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- accessories</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- bca</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- beautify</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- carved_wood</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- cobblecuisine</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- cobbledollars</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- cobblefurnies</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- cobblenav</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- cobbleverse</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- cobbleversebadges</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- cobbreeding</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- comforts</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- cozyhome</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- handcrafted</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- legendarymonuments</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- lumymon</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- moarconcrete</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- more_cobblemon_tweaks</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- musicnotification</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- obc</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- pokeblocks</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- rctmod</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- rechiseled</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- roughlyenoughitems</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- sophisticatedbackpacks</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- sophisticatedcore</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- sophisticatedstorage</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- tmcraft</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- waystones</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- xaerominimap</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- xaeroworldmap</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- zamega</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span><span>未包含在 COBBLEVERSE 中但相容的已翻譯模組列表：</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span><span>- catchrate-display<br>- cobbledgacha<br>- cobbledollars_villagers_overhaul_rca<br>- cobblemon_quick_teams</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span><span>- cobblemon_spawn_alerts</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span><span>- cobblemon_utility<br>- cobblemonintegrations<br>- cobblemonmovedex</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span><span>- constructionwand</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span><span>-&nbsp;openpartiesandclaims&nbsp;<br>- patapoke</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- pcenhancements</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span><span>我並非資源包或 Minecraft 資料包的專家，這是利用業餘時間製作的專案。因此，若發現任何翻譯錯誤，或有未翻譯/誤譯的內容，歡迎隨時向我反映！</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1565/277/capture-da-c-cran-2026-02-09-225519-png.png\" alt=\"替代文字\"></span></p>",
